/// @brief Encrypts and decrypts saved passwords with ChaCha20-Poly1305 (RFC 8439).
///
/// ChaCha20 is the cipher (it scrambles the text); Poly1305 is an authentication tag that
/// detects any change to the stored value, so a tampered or corrupted password fails to decrypt
